    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You launch rays of arcane frost at up to two targets within range that are no more than 30 feet apart. Make a ranged spell attack against each one. On a hit, a target takes 2d6 Force damage and its Speed drops by 10 feet until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p>",
